{"sha": "b67172c0c5713366a41316e8ed27b480f0ca8c389e6ede7f88cbad6aea174f86", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:point-kinematics} 章 --- 质点运动学}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:1}", "$v = 4.0t$：\\qty{3.0}{s} 时为 \\qty{12}{m/s}；$a = \\qty{4.0}{m/s^2}$；", "$x(5) = \\qty{50}{m}$；$\\qty{100}{km/h} = \\qty{27.8}{m/s}$，此时 $t = 27.8/4.0", "= \\qty{6.9}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:2}", "$\\dot r = 0$，$\\dot\\theta = \\qty{3.0}{rad/s}$：$\\vect v = r\\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta", "= 6.0\\,\\vect e_\\theta$（\\unit{m/s}）；$\\vect a = -r\\dot\\theta^2\\vect e_r =", "-18\\,\\vect e_r$（\\unit{m/s^2}）。匀速圆周运动：速率不变，", "向心加速度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:3}", "$v = 2\\pi R/T = 2\\pi \\times 6.37\\times10^6/86164 = \\qty{465}{m/s}$；", "$a = v^2/R = \\qty{0.034}{m/s^2}$，即 $g/290$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:4}", "$v_0\\sin\\alpha = \\qty{7.71}{m/s}$，$v_0\\cos\\alpha = \\qty{9.19}{m/s}$。", "最高点位于 $t = 7.71/9.81 = \\qty{0.79}{s}$ 时，高度为 $7.71^2/(2 \\times 9.81) =", "\\qty{3.0}{m}$。射程为 $2 \\times 9.19 \\times 0.786 = \\qty{14.5}{m}$。", "落地时速度为 $(9.19, -7.71)$，大小为 \\qty{12}{m/s}，与", "水平方向成 $40^\\circ$ 角，斜向下。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:5}", "$a_T = \\qty{1.0}{m/s^2}$，$a_N = 10^2/25 = \\qty{4.0}{m/s^2}$，$a =", "\\qty{4.1}{m/s^2}$。\\qty{5}{s} 后：$v = \\qty{15}{m/s}$，$a_N = 225/25 =", "\\qty{9.0}{m/s^2}$，$a = \\qty{9.1}{m/s^2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:6}", "$r = b\\omega t$，$\\dot r = b\\omega$，$\\ddot r = 0$，$\\dot\\theta = \\omega$：", "$\\vect v = b\\omega\\,\\vect e_r + b\\omega^2 t\\,\\vect e_\\theta$，$v = b\\omega", "\\sqrt{1 + \\omega^2t^2}$；$\\vect a = -b\\omega^3 t\\,\\vect e_r + 2b\\omega^2\\,", "\\vect e_\\theta$。$2\\dot r\\dot\\theta$ 项含两个相等的部分：", "径向速度方向的转动速率为 $\\dot\\theta$（给出", "$\\dot r\\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta$），向外运动使横向速率 $r\\dot\\theta$ 增大（再给出", "另一个 $\\dot r\\dot\\theta$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:7}", "$v = \\sqrt{(2.0 \\times 1.0)^2 + 0.5^2} = \\qty{2.1}{m/s}$；$a = R\\omega^2 =", "\\qty{2.0}{m/s^2}$，指向轴线；螺距 $v_z \\times 2\\pi/\\omega =", "\\qty{3.1}{m}$；$\\rho = v^2/a = 4.25/2.0 = \\qty{2.1}{m} > R$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:8}", "$v_{\\max} = A\\omega = \\qty{1.0}{m/s}$；$a_{\\max} = A\\omega^2 = \\qty{10}{m/s^2}$；", "$v$ 比 $x$ 超前四分之一周期，$a = -\\omega^2x$ 与 $x$ 反向。", "$\\abs v$ 在 $x = 0$ 处最大，$\\abs a$ 在端点 $x = \\pm A$ 处最大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:9}", "$\\dot{\\vect e}_r = \\dot\\theta(-\\sin\\theta\\,\\vect e_x + \\cos\\theta\\,\\vect e_y)", "= \\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta$；$\\dot{\\vect e}_\\theta = \\dot\\theta(-\\cos\\theta\\,", "\\vect e_x - \\sin\\theta\\,\\vect e_y) = -\\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_r$。于是", "$\\vect v = \\dot r\\vect e_r + r\\dot\\theta\\vect e_\\theta$，对其再求一次导数，并用乘积法则，", "即得\\cref{thm:b1:point-kinematics:cylindrical}中的加速度。", "\\cref{thm:b1:point-kinematics:cylindrical}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:10}", "最高点：$v = v_0\\cos\\alpha$，$a_N = g$，$\\rho = v_0^2\\cos^2\\alpha/g$。", "抛出时：$v = v_0$，$a_N = g\\cos\\alpha$，$\\rho = v_0^2/(g\\cos\\alpha)$。", "最高点处的曲率半径是抛出点的 $\\cos^3\\alpha$ 倍：抛物线在", "速率最小、且 $\\vect g$ 全部为法向的地方弯曲最厉害。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:11}", "$\\dot x = v - v\\cos(vt/R)$，$\\dot y = v\\sin(vt/R)$；$\\ddot x = (v^2/R)", "\\sin(vt/R)$，$\\ddot y = (v^2/R)\\cos(vt/R)$。在地面处（$vt/R = 2\\pi n$）：", "$\\dot x = \\dot y = 0$，$\\vect a = (0, v^2/R)$，方向向上。在顶部", "（$vt/R = \\pi$）：$\\dot x = 2v$，$\\dot y = 0$，速率为 $2v$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:point-kinematics:12}", "$\\ddot r = 0$，$\\dot r = u$，$\\dot\\theta = \\omega$：$\\vect a = -ut\\omega^2\\,", "\\vect e_r + 2u\\omega\\,\\vect e_\\theta$。当 $t = \\qty{2.0}{s}$ 时：$-2.0\\,\\vect e_r", "+ 2.0\\,\\vect e_\\theta$（\\unit{m/s^2}）。第一项是转动的向心项；", "第二项 $2\\dot r\\dot\\theta$ 只因", "径向方向本身在转动 --- 在地面上，沿直线以恒定速率行走时，", "根本没有加速度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:point-kinematics:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\vect v = R\\dot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta$；$\\vect a = -R\\dot\\theta^2", "\\,\\vect e_r + R\\ddot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\vect T = \\vect e_\\theta$（$\\theta$ 增大的运动方向），", "$\\vect N = -\\vect e_r$（指向 $C$），$\\rho = R$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 最高点：$v^2 = 625 - 392 = 233$，$v = \\qty{15.3}{m/s}$。侧边处：", "$625 - 196 = 429$，$v = \\qty{20.7}{m/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $2v\\dot v = -2gR\\sin\\theta\\,\\dot\\theta$，且 $v = R\\dot\\theta$：", "$\\dot v = -g\\sin\\theta$。当 $0 < \\theta < \\pi$ 时为负（上升途中减速），", "下降途中为正。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $a_N = v^2/R = v_0^2/R - 2g(1 - \\cos\\theta)$；最低点", "\\qty{62.5}{m/s^2}；侧边 $62.5 - 19.6 = \\qty{42.9}{m/s^2}$；最高点 $62.5 -", "39.2 = \\qty{23.3}{m/s^2}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 最低点：\\qty{62.5}{m/s^2}（无切向分量）；侧边：", "$\\sqrt{42.9^2 + 9.81^2} = \\qty{44.0}{m/s^2}$；最高点：\\qty{23.3}{m/s^2}，", "方向竖直向下、指向 $C$，与竖直方向的夹角为 $0$。", ""]}